00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Sometimes we feel that the overall fold is less or more flat after we finish the costume, and we will get more fold details through some adjustments.

2
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:28,000
First, select a costume version and select the interior of the colon layer, and then remove the face.

3
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Then press Ctrl D to create a symmetrical version, and select to add to the inside.

4
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:49,000
The reason for selecting the interior of the colon layer is that the outer layer has a pocket version, and if the colon is on the outer layer, the powder line of the pocket will penetrate the version, and there will be instability.

5
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Due to the cancellation of the connection of the inner layer, the extra inner line on the version of the colon can be deleted.

6
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:07,000
If you don't delete it, when the colon layer is automatically formed, the powder line will pull the costume, and some unnecessary folds will occur.

7
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Since there is already a copy of the inside as the basis, we can increase the number of layers.

8
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Use the edit text tool to select the layer, and you can see that the layer has been deleted.

9
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:37,000
In the case of the main color, you can see that the pattern is in the direction of the kill line, which is parallel to the arrow, and the golden line and the vertical is the tail.

10
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:46,000
First, we increase the tail lock rate, so that the outer layer can be widened horizontally.

11
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:51,000
Then, increase the golden lock rate to lengthen the outer layer, and since the outer layer is relatively large, there will be folds.

12
00:01:51,000 --> 00:02:06,840
At the seam line, it is especially obvious, because the

13
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:22,980
seam line of pocket is still the size of the original one.

14
00:02:25,379 --> 00:02:33,480
On the pleats that have more or less seam lines such as the pocket,

15
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:46,840
At this time, we can use another function, which is the ruler function.

16
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:51,840
After selecting the ruler tool, when the collection rate is positive, you can stretch the grid.

17
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:55,840
When the collection rate is negative, you can search the grid.

18
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:59,840
The pocket plates are more likely to have folds in the division and division.

19
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:06,840
Therefore, when we want the collection rate to be positive, we need to create a positive ruler along the edge of the outer plate.

20
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:14,840
Then reduce the particle distance and simulate it.

21
00:03:14,840 --> 00:03:19,840
In addition, if you need a fold on the clothes plate due to the division of the pocket,

22
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:25,840
please set the inner line of the pocket to the ratio of 98 to 99.

23
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:34,840
In addition, the pocket plates of the collection are related to the joint.

24
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:37,840
Therefore, it is not possible to create a symmetrical plate directly.

25
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:44,840
You need to remove the joint first to be symmetrical.

26
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:50,840
The physical properties of the changed fabric can also produce different fold textures.

27
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:54,840
Increase the strength of the elastic band and the strength of the corner line.

28
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:56,840
The stretchability of the fabric becomes worse.

29
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:58,840
The inner layer of the clothing continues to become smaller.

30
00:03:58,840 --> 00:03:59,840
The fold will be smaller.

31
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:04,840
The fold will be more easy to produce.

32
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:12,840
The overall texture of the fabric will also become deeper.

33
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:15,840
After reducing the bending strength, the fold will become thinner.

34
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:21,840
It looks deeper.

35
00:04:21,840 --> 00:04:23,840
Pay attention to this part.

36
00:04:23,840 --> 00:04:28,840
The original soft fold will become more sharp.

37
00:04:28,840 --> 00:04:30,840
The fold will become thinner.

38
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:32,840
The fold will become thinner.

39
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:34,840
The fold will become thinner.

